msgstr "Split method"

msgid "請填寫每位分攤成員的金額。"
msgstr "Enter an amount for each selected member."

msgid "每位分攤成員的金額必須大於 0。"
msgstr "Each selected member's amount must be greater than zero."

msgid "每人分攤金額加總必須等於支出金額。"
msgstr "The member amounts must add up to the expense total."

msgid "請輸入支出名稱。"
msgstr "Enter an expense name."

msgid "付款者必須屬於這個活動。"
msgstr "The payer must belong to this activity."

msgid "參與分攤的成員必須屬於這個活動。"
msgstr "Members sharing the expense must belong to this activity."

msgid "記下誰先付款，以及哪些成員要一起分攤。"
msgstr "Record who paid and which members share the expense."

msgid "支出內容"
msgstr "Expense details"

msgid "輸入項目名稱與實際支付金額。"
msgstr "Enter a description and the amount paid."

msgid "付款與分攤"
msgstr "Payment and sharing"

msgid "第一版會在勾選的成員之間平均分攤。"
msgstr "The expense is split equally among selected members."

