msgstr "Enter amounts for selected members only. They must add up to the expense total."

msgid "每筆支出，都能照實際情況分攤"
msgstr "Split each expense the way it was shared"

msgid "平均分攤適合共同消費；各自餐點價格不同時，改選自訂金額即可。"
msgstr "Split shared purchases equally, or use custom amounts when each meal costs a different amount."

