msgstr "If the amount cannot be divided evenly, SplitMate allocates the remainder by the smallest currency unit."

msgid "分帳結果"
msgstr "Settlement"

msgid "把帳算清楚，"
msgstr "Settle the bill,"

msgid "把回憶留下。"
msgstr "keep the memories."

msgid "每一分錢都精確分配，照著下方結果付款即可。"
msgstr "Every cent is accounted for. Follow the payments below to settle up."

msgid "每位成員的帳目"
msgstr "Member balances"

msgid "實付"
msgstr "Paid"

msgid "應負擔"
msgstr "Owes"

msgid "應收款"
msgstr "To receive"

msgid "應付款"
msgstr "To pay"

msgid "已結清"
msgstr "Settled"

msgid "建議付款方式"
msgstr "Suggested payments"

msgid "計算明細"
msgstr "Calculation details"

msgid "："
msgstr ": "

msgid "關閉計算明細"
msgstr "Close calculation details"

msgid "先計算每筆支出的個人分攤，再將整個活動中每人的實付與應負擔相減。"
msgstr "First calculate each person's share of every expense, then subtract what each person owes from what they paid across the activity."

msgid "每筆支出與分攤"
msgstr "Expenses and shares"

msgid "每人淨額"
msgstr "Net balance per member"

msgid "依支出計算：誰該付給誰"
msgstr "By expense: who owes whom"

msgid "已抵銷同兩人之間的反向代墊，尚未重新安排付款對象。"
msgstr "Amounts paid on each other's behalf have been offset between the same two people; payment recipients have not been reassigned."

msgid "沒有需要代付的金額"
msgstr "No payments owed to another member"

msgid "實付 − 應負擔 = 淨額"
msgstr "Paid − owed = net balance"

msgid "為什麼付款對象可能不同？"
msgstr "Why might the payment recipient be different?"

msgid "下方建議是將全活動應付款與應收款的淨額配對，讓每個人的帳目歸零；付款對象不一定是原本替你支付某筆支出的人。"
msgstr "The suggestions match net amounts owed and due across the whole activity to bring everyone's balance to zero. The recipient may not be the person who paid for a particular expense on your behalf."

msgid "%(debtor)s 付款給 %(creditor)s"
msgstr "%(debtor)s pays %(creditor)s"

msgid "尚無可結算支出"
msgstr "No expenses to settle yet"

msgid "新增支出後，這裡會自動整理每個人的應付與應收款。"
msgstr "Add expenses to see what each member owes and is owed."

msgid "目前不需要任何轉帳"
msgstr "No transfers needed"

msgid "所有人的 Balance 都已歸零，這個活動已經結清。"
msgstr "All balances are zero. This activity is settled."

msgid "、"
msgstr ", "

msgid "未付款"
msgstr "Unpaid"

msgid "已付款"
msgstr "Paid"

msgid "標記為已付款"
msgstr "Mark as paid"

msgid "取消付款標記"
msgstr "Mark as unpaid"
